wasm-bindgen-futures and reqwest depend on features not provided by the
bin-NMUed web-sys. if we integrate the binNMU and maintain a list of features
to be provided by web-sys, they need to be looked at/integrated. if we decide
to collapse all features altogether, they need to be switched to that new
mechanism as well.

https://salsa.debian.org/rust-team/debcargo-conf/issues/17
